  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000txwp](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000txwp) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 12 2026 11km NW of Emirau Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -1.5882 longitude 149.8877. It impacted 5118 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
